+# Evidence-search prototype — independent review and disposition
+
+**Candidate reviewed:** `19c8199ce2781d05ff1a7be176002a0ed98f3917`  
+**Reviewer:** Antonina-managed read-only agent `2fIY7xtP1V64PNRAhcC6ha-robinson`  
+**Review result:** approve with non-blocking suggestions (output completed 2026-11-14; exact SHA and tree inspected).
+
+## Verified scope and tests
+
+The independent reviewer confirmed that the candidate adds only an
+operator-invoked search helper, its smoke test, and a research note. It is not
+called from boot or dispatch, writes no index/state, installs no software, and
+does not create a source of truth. The reviewer ran POSIX shell syntax checks
+and `tests/innovation-evidence-search-smoke.sh`; both passed. The candidate
+worktree's full `sh tests/run-all.sh` suite also passed before review.
+
+## Review findings
+
+- No blocking shell, safety, scope, or legal defect was identified.
+- The helper is a thin wrapper over existing `rg` or `git grep`. The reviewer
+  judged its incremental value marginal and recommended the no-code baseline
+  (direct commands or a short recipe) unless real use demonstrates time saved
+  or fewer missed findings.
+- The smoke test has a minor environment assumption (`/usr/bin:/bin`) in its
+  forced-Git-fallback path; no false pass was observed.
+- The report's observed count was 15 when measured before adding the query text
+  to the report. A later exact-candidate search returns 16 because the report
+  now contains its own search phrase. This is a self-inclusion effect, not
+  evidence that the underlying repository gained another source result. The
+  single wall-clock observation (~0.019 seconds) is not a comparative
+  benchmark.
+
+## Office disposition
+
+**Do not publish or integrate the wrapper now.** The prototype establishes
+that existing Free Software can retrieve prior evidence, but it does not
+establish an outcome advantage over direct `rg`/`git grep`; the independent
+review supports the simpler no-code baseline. Preserve the exact prototype
+commit and review worktree as a rejected integration candidate, rather than
+deleting the experiment or expanding it into a subsystem. Reconsider only if a
+real inquiry documents repeated retrieval failures or measurable time saved
+from the wrapper.
+
+This disposition is an Executive implementation decision about its own
+prototype, not a legislative action or Judiciary finding. The prototype was
+not deployed, and no independent outcome improvement is claimed.
